+        "preset's measured wall-clock and operation count are recorded by "
+        "selftest, while the difference-multiplicity route needs at most 230 "
+        "modular arithmetic operations once the affine symmetry is seen."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 20,
+}
+
+NATIVE = {
