For
1513, 3470, 6713,
use Proposition \ref{prp:18^5-18^4} with decompositions of
$K_{18^4}$, $K_{18^5}$
and design orders
73, 145, 217, 433.

For
7700, 7840, 7847,
use Proposition \ref{prp:18^5-9^9} with decompositions of
$K_{18^5}$, $K_{72^7}$, $K_{9^9}$
and design orders
73, 145, 217, 289, 577, 1009.

See Lemmas~\ref{lem-Design-24-4}--\ref{lem-Design-73-et-al} for the relevant graph decompositions.
