$1$, $2$, $3$, $4$, $17$, $18$, $20$, $22$, $23$, $24$, $201$, $203$, $206$, $207$, $228$, $312$, $527$, $529$, $590$, $599$, $601$, $850$, $1106$, $1233$, $1261$, $1698$, $1702$, $1825$, $1835$, $1839$, $2040$, $2045$, $2051$, $2053$, $2471$, $2562$, $2563$, $2574$, $2581$, $3179$, $3191$, $3193$, $3241$, $3243$, $6383$, $6385$, $6390$, $6397$ and $6401$,
