Implemented and locally verified a native Track B generator based on Lemma 4.7 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.02846).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `n=480`, order `1009`, 14 markers.
- All local G1–G9 gates pass.
- Guessing: 0 valid answers in 200,000 structure-aware samples.
- Mechanical route: 8,967,084 operations across eight instances.
- Compact symmetry route: at most 234 operations.
- 700 additional construction and escalation instances verified.
- Answer bound: 69 characters, 18 estimated tokens, 12 elements.

