\begin{lemma} \label{lem-Design-24-4}
For each of the 12-vertex, 6-regular graphs
$$201, 6383, 6397, 6401, 6753, 7677, 7754,$$
there exists an edgewise decomposition of the complete multipartite graph $K_{24^4}$ into $96$ copies of the graph.
